CREATED:20230710T061312Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nCareer Jam (SG) – Debunking Myths on Internal Mobil
	ity\nSynopsis\n:\nPlanning on moving internally? Heard of urban myths arou
	nd internal mobility? Join us as we hear from your colleagues who have don
	e it\, and managers who believe in it to debunk any misconceptions you may
	 have.\nSpeaker\n:\nMatthew Eng Chye LEE\nElaine Leh Chin CHONG\nChun Meng
	 TEE\nPremshila Shilpan JOSHI\nShivani SINGH\nModerator\n:\nWilliam Tanoto
	 TAN \nJoining Instructions\n(via Webex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first 
	time participant using DBS laptop\, you must follow this  One Time Webex S
	etup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <https://dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/person
	al/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzB
	Dh2>  guide prior to the event. This will install Webex Meeting App from D
	BS Software Centre for optimal streaming experience!\n1.	On the day of the
	 event\, click on this hyperlink: Webex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com/
	dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=ebba34ae8cf4954e99a3843031f5d5b75> \n2.	Enter your 
	First Name\, Last Name\, Email Address and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin
	 via Mobile Device\n1.	Download Webex Meetings App from Apple App Store or
	 Google PlayStore\nClick on Join Meeting & Input Meeting Number: 2515 914 
	8254\n2.	Input Password 1234\n \n \nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +6
	5-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +852-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-
	6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeti
	ng Number:  2515 914 8254\nGlobal call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/d
	bs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e1be1d7fb8cf19dadf242f64798d49372> \n \n \n \n \n
	 \n \n
